<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market was closed on Friday for the beginning of a three-day holiday. It will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the weighted index ended up 163.68 points, or 2.00 percent, at 8,367.57. Turnover was a very heavy T$181.4 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
